SECTION 42. Fishery License/ Permit. All individuals, cooperatives, partnership, firms or corporations who are listed in the Registry of Municipal Fishers/Fisherfolks Registration (FishR) shall be issued Fishery License, upon payment of the prescribed fee: Provided, however, that the Fishery License is non-transferable: Provided further, that the holder agree unconditionally to comply with all the laws, orders, policies, and rules and regulations governing fishing. The license shall also assume responsibility, for any and all of his acts with his fishing operation.
