- Sari-sari store, banks, clinics, pawnshops, gas stations, dry goods within public market, drugstores
• Commercial B - 150% of the residential service
- Eatery, restaurants, refreshment parlors, spa, salon/parlor, car wash, hospitals, hog fattening with five hogs and above, poultry, lodging houses
• Commercial C - 175% of the residential service
- wet market, water purifying stations/water vending, hollow blocks making, construction plants.
Industrial Service 200% of the residential service
- manufacturing and industrial plants
Waterworks Code of Sta. Cruz | Page 13
b. For every cubic meter in excess of 10 cubic meter per month
Residential Service
₱1 8.60/cubic meter
