**SECTION 6. Appropriations.** The budget necessary to carry out the provisions of this Ordinance, following its enactment, shall be taken from the five percent (5%) GAD Budget, and shall be included in the ensuing Appropriation Ordinance, embodying the annual or supplemental budget, and every year hereafter, the same shall be included in the annual budget of the municipal government of the Municipality of Sta. Cruz.
**SECTION 7. Separability Clause.** Should any section or provision of this Ordinance be declared void and ineffective by final judgment of a competent judicial authority, the other provisions hereof, not affected thereby, shall continue to be in full force and effect.
**SECTION 8. Repealing Clause.** This ordinance expressly amends Section 125 of Municipal Ordinance No. 02, series of 2012 or the Gender and Development (GAD) Code of the Municipality of Sta. Cruz and Municipal Ordinance No. 08, series of 2014 or the Revised Organizational Structure and Staffing Pattern of the Municipal Government of Sta. Cruz, Davao del Sur, as amended.
**SECTION 9. Effectivity Clause** - This ordinance shall take effect upon approval.
